   121	// reporting the local project truth while list/ready go quiet — exactly the
   122	// split that makes this so hard to diagnose from the CLI alone.
   123	//
   124	// The notice text and remediation command are branched on rule, the
   125	// routing.RoutingRule that actually matched in determineAutoRoutedRepoPath,
   126	// so a maintainer- or default-routed swap doesn't get misattributed to
   127	// beads.role=contributor.
